<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"><ttm:name type="full">Vocal 1</ttm:name></ttm:agent><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" leadingSilence="0.440"><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="en-US"><text for="L1">If only it were a dream, how much better would it be</text><text for="L2">I still dream of you even now</text><text for="L3">As if going back to get something I forgot</text><text for="L4">I brush the dust off of old memories</text><text for="L5">There is a happiness that will never return</text><text for="L6">You were the last one to teach me that</text><text for="L7">Even the dark past I hid without saying a word</text><text for="L8">Without you, it would have remained dark forever</text><text for="L9">I'm sure that I can't be hurt</text><text for="L10">Any more than this, I know that now</text><text for="L11">Even the sadness of that day, even the pain of that day</text><text for="L12">I loved it all, along with you</text><text for="L13">The bitter scent of lemon that won't leave my heart</text><text for="L14">I can't go home until the rain stops falling</text><text for="L15">Even now, you are my light</text><text for="L16">In the darkness, I traced your back</text><text for="L17">I remember its outline so clearly</text><text for="L18">Every time I encounter something I can't accept</text><text for="L19">The only thing that won't stop overflowing is my tears</text><text for="L20">What were you doing, what were you looking at</text><text for="L21">With a side profile I didn't know</text><text for="L22">If somewhere, you are now, just like me</text><text for="L23">Drowning in tears and in the midst of loneliness</text><text for="L24">Please, just forget about me</text><text for="L25">To the point that I wish for such a thing from my heart</text><text for="L26">Even now, you are my light</text><text for="L27">More than I thought</text><text for="L28">I was in love with you</text><text for="L29">Ever since then, as I'd expect</text><text for="L30">I can't breathe</text><text for="L31">Even though you were so close to me</text><text for="L32">It's almost like a lie</text><text for="L33">I can't possibly forget</text><text for="L34">That's the only thing that's certain</text><text for="L35">Even the sadness of that day, even the pain of that day</text><text for="L36">I loved it all, along with you</text><text for="L37">The bitter scent of lemon that won't leave my heart</text><text for="L38">I can't go home until the rain stops falling</text><text for="L39">Like one half of a sliced piece of fruit</text><text for="L40">Even now, you are my light</text></translation></translations><songwriters><songwriter>米津玄師</songwriter></songwriters><transliterations><transliteration xml:lang="ja-Latn"><text for="L1"><span begin="1.241" end="1.635" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">yume</span> <span begin="1.635" end="2.152" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">nara</span> <span begin="2.152" end="2.651" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">ba</span> <span begin="2.651" end="3.352" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">dore</span><span begin="3.352" end="4.003" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">hodo</span> <span begin="4.003" end="4.352" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">yo</span><span begin="4.352" end="4.920" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">katta</span> <span begin="4.920" end="5.368" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">de</span><span begin="5.368" end="6.433" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">shou</span></text><text for="L2"><span begin="6.781" end="7.805" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">imada</span> <span begin="7.805" end="8.120" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">ni</span> <span begin="8.120" end="8.514" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">ana</span><span begin="8.514" end="9.138" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/t